      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEL LICIOUS (2) has been tackling much better opposition in the Breeders Challenge series in Sydney so far this time in, chasing the fillies that ultimately ran one-two in the final in her two starts off a long spell. She'll relish the big drop to maiden company and draws well. MACHETE RANGER (1) is a filly by Ultimate Machete making her debut. Trialling strongly, winning her latest hitout at Young, and the ace draw is aid to a first starter. SHES PRETTY LOU (4) is building in fitness and could be close to a win after placing in both outings off a spell, finishing third at Young last time out. HY LEESTRUNG (7) is a colt by Stay Hungry on debut. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw but there has been merit in his trial efforts.",
